data: {"id": "eb2468830aef480b-thinking-parallel_evidence-1814", "run_id": "eb2468830aef480b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n**Pod 身份与生命周期**\n- Pod `aiops-case-v13/workload` (UID: 421d2011-e1c6-4338-ab02-e6917195141f) 仍存在于集群中，phase=Running，nodeName=node2。\n\n**deletionTimestamp 与 finalizers（核心证据）**\n- `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-14T07:50:39Z` 已存在，说明删除请求已发出。\n- `deletionGracePeriodSeconds: 3900`（即 65 分钟）。\n- `finalizers: <none>` — **无任何 finalizer 阻塞**。\n- `terminationGracePeriodSeconds: 3900`，与 deletionGracePeriodSeconds 一致。\n\n**Events**\n- 48s 前：`Warning Unhealthy — Readiness probe failed: command timed out`\n- 46s 前：", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789368398117, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

